{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../get_chat_history_count/", "title": "get_chat_history_count()"}, "next": {"link": "../get_messages/", "title": "get_messages()"}, "title": "read_chat_history()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"read-chat-history\">\n<h1>read_chat_history()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#read-chat-history\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.read_chat_history\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">read_chat_history</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.read_chat_history\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Mark a chat\u2019s message history as read.</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\" style=\"color: var(--color-red)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>chat_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> | <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Unique identifier (int) or username (str) of the target chat.\nFor your personal cloud (Saved Messages) you can simply use \u201cme\u201d or \u201cself\u201d.\nFor a contact that exists in your Telegram address book you can use his phone number (str).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>max_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The id of the last message you want to mark as read; all the messages before this one will be marked as\nread as well. Defaults to 0 (mark every unread message as read).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code> - On success, True is returned.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"c1\"># Mark the whole chat as read</span>\n<span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read_chat_history</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Mark messages as read only up to the given message id</span>\n<span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read_chat_history</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">12345</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/methods/get_messages", "get_messages()", "N", "next"], ["api/methods/get_chat_history_count", "get_chat_history_count()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">read_chat_history()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.read_chat_history\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.read_chat_history()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/methods/read_chat_history", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}